# ── LOCAL ONLY ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The repo carries ONLY what the live site needs to run. Everything below is the
# working set: sources, generators and internal docs. Keep it backed up yourself —
# it is NOT in git. Without it the site still runs, but it cannot be regenerated.

# internal docs
_guide/
CLAUDE.md

# generators (the site ships their OUTPUT, not the tooling)
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# copy SOURCES — the browser reads the data/*.js mirrors, never these
data/*.json
assets/clients/manifest.json

# asset SOURCES and unused variants
assets/hero-baghdad.png
assets/logo.jpg
assets/logo-icon-light.png
assets/logo-word-light.png
assets/logo-full-dark.png
*.bak

# dev pages
theme-board.html

# misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
